<article class="env-remark" id="05YX">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05YX">Remark <span data-tag="05YX">59.45.3</span>.</a> In the situation of Theorem <a href="/tag/04DZ" data-tag="04DZ">59.45.2</a> it is also true that $V \mapsto V_ X$ induces an equivalence between those étale morphisms $V \to Y$ with $V$ affine and those étale morphisms $U \to X$ with $U$ affine. This follows for example from Limits, Proposition <a href="/tag/05YU" data-tag="05YU">32.11.2</a>. </p>
